 7. 🗞️ NYT @ 175 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Sara Fischer/Axios The first issue of The New York Times was published 175 years ago today, on Sept. 18, 1851.

 Above: At a birthday party in Manhattan last night, Senate Minority Leader Chuck Schumer (D-N.Y.) and Mark Thompson — CEO of CNN Worldwide and former CEO of The New York Times Company — watch Pulitzer-winning Times reporters Megan Twohey and Jodi Kantor salute Ashley Judd for being the first actress to speak out against Harvey Weinstein. Images: The New York Times Then and now ... New York Times front pages, 175 years apart.

